sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Test
    participant Car as EvController
    participant Driver as EvDriverSim
    participant Yeti as YetiSimulator
    participant Evse as EvseManager

    Test->>Car: m2e/configure_session
    Test->>Driver: m2e/plug
    Driver->>Car: bsp_event A
    Driver-->>Test: e2m/world_state Passed, command_ack Accepted

    Note over Car: A begins the configured session
    Car->>Driver: set_cp_state(B)
    Driver->>Yeti: set_cp_state(B)
    Yeti->>Evse: pilot B
    Evse->>Yeti: PWM on
    Yeti->>Driver: bsp_measurement (duty)
    Driver->>Car: bsp_measurement (duty)
    Car->>Driver: set_cp_state(C), allow_power_on(true)
    Driver->>Yeti: set_cp_state(C), allow_power_on(true)
    Note over Car,Evse: Charging

    Test->>Driver: m2e/unplug
    Driver->>Yeti: set_cp_state(A)
    Driver->>Car: bsp_event Disconnected
    Driver-->>Test: e2m/world_state Withheld, command_ack Accepted
    Note over Car: Unplugged
